{"id":"a1ee52f416d487e3","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-maximal-consistent.md","title":"GL Maximal Consistent","display":"df-gl-maximal-consistent — GL Maximal Consistent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-maximal-consistent","aliases":["89-df-gl-maximal-consistent"],"display":"df-gl-maximal-consistent — GL Maximal Consistent","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-consistent-extension]]","[[89-df-modal-negation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-maximal-consistent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-maximal-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-maximal-consistent — GL Maximal Consistent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3987a9cfc50008a9\" href=\"?note=3987a9cfc50008a9\" title=\"89-df-gl-consistent-extension\">89-df-gl-consistent-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5dbb49ee42ea9770\" href=\"?note=5dbb49ee42ea9770\" title=\"89-df-modal-negation\">89-df-modal-negation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\\)</span> is the predicate from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3987a9cfc50008a9\" href=\"?note=3987a9cfc50008a9\" title=\"89-df-gl-consistent-extension\">89-df-gl-consistent-extension</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in S\\lor\\neg A\\in S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in S\\lor\\neg A\\in S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL 的极大一致扩展对每个公式恰含该公式或其否定之一；“至少一个”由\n显示的完备性条件给出，“不能同时包含”由一致性与经典闭包推出。</li>\n<li>极大一致集用于构造规范模型</li>\n<li>极大一致集是完全性证明的核心</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-consistent-extension","status":"resolved","id":"3987a9cfc50008a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-consistent-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-negation","status":"resolved","id":"5dbb49ee42ea9770","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-consistent-extension","status":"resolved","id":"3987a9cfc50008a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)$ is the predicate from\n[[89-df-gl-consistent-extension]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in S\\lor\\neg A\\in S).","display":true}],"bytes":1007,"backlinks":[{"id":